--[[
    SHAPEX TERMINAL — Rayfield-style Edition
    ------------------------------------------------
    A self-contained LocalScript UI library styled after Rayfield's
    API (Window:CreateTab, Tab:CreateSection, Section:CreateToggle, etc.)
    but skinned in your dark hacker-terminal aesthetic.

    SCOPE / SAFETY NOTE:
    This build only reads and displays LOCAL PLAYER data (health, walkspeed,
    position, FPS, ping, etc.) and local client settings (theme, UI scale,
    keybinds). It contains NO remote calls, NO other-player lookups, and
    NO exploit tooling (no fling/aimbot/hitbox/etc). If you want to extend
    it, add tabs using the CreateTab/CreateSection pattern below — self-only.

    HOW TO USE:
    1. Drop this whole file into a LocalScript (StarterPlayerScripts or
       via your executor).
    2. To add a new tab:  local myTab = Window:CreateTab("My Tab", "🔧")
    3. To add a section:  local sec = myTab:CreateSection("My Section")
    4. To add components: sec:CreateToggle({...}) / CreateButton / CreateSlider
       / CreateLabel / CreateDropdown  — see examples at bottom of file.
]]

